## Human intervention needed

The automated job failed during final native-image test generation/validation. Preserved work is available at: https://github.com/oracle/graalvm-reachability-metadata/tree/ai%2Fkimeta%2Fhuman-intervention%2Fissue-9946-library-new-request-com.sun.xml.ws-httpspi-servlet-4.0.5-ab4869c1

The generated header/adapter tests passed native verification, but the later `DeploymentDescriptorParserTest.parsesEndpointConfigurationAndLoadsItsImplementation` test repeatedly fails at `nativeTestCompile`. Native Image reports an `UnsupportedFeatureException`: a runtime-initialized `com.ctc.wstx.stax.WstxInputFactory` instance is embedded through `DeploymentDescriptorParser.parse`. This is a class-initialization/image-heap problem, not a missing reachability registration; the metadata repair stage therefore made no changes because build-time initialization directives are prohibited.

Dynamic-access coverage is unavailable because the native image never produced the required `dynamic-access` input. Metrics ended with `status: failure` after 14 iterations and recorded no usable coverage or metadata entries.

